# BluetoothFriends

An Android application that discovers and tracks nearby Bluetooth devices over time, creating a social network of device encounters.

## Overview

BluetoothFriends is an Android app that continuously scans for Bluetooth devices in your vicinity and maintains a history of your encounters with them. The app tracks when and where you've been near specific devices, allowing you to see patterns in your daily interactions with the Bluetooth-enabled world around you.

## Features

- **Automatic Bluetooth Scanning**: Background service that periodically scans for nearby Bluetooth devices
- **Device Tracking**: Records and stores information about discovered devices including MAC address, device name, and device class
- **Encounter History**: Maintains a detailed log of all encounters with each device, including timestamps and location data
- **Friends List**: View all discovered devices and their encounter statistics
- **Surrounding Devices**: See real-time view of currently nearby Bluetooth devices
- **Online Leaderboard**: Compare your encounter statistics with other users
- **Notifications**: Get notified when frequently encountered devices are nearby
- **Custom Device Names**: Assign friendly names to devices for easy identification

## Technical Details

- **Platform**: Android (Minimum SDK 7)
- **Package**: com.alexanderbatten.bluetoothfriends
- **Database**: SQLite for local device and encounter storage
- **Services**: Background services for Bluetooth scanning and server synchronization

## Permissions Required

- `BLUETOOTH`: Access Bluetooth hardware
- `BLUETOOTH_ADMIN`: Enable Bluetooth discovery
- `ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION`: Record location data for encounters
- `INTERNET`: Sync data with online leaderboard
- `VIBRATE`: Provide haptic feedback for notifications
- `RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED`: Start services on device boot
- `WAKE_LOCK`: Keep device awake during Bluetooth scans

## Project Structure

- `src/com/alexanderbatten/bluetoothfriends/`: Java source code
  - `BluetoothService.java`: Background Bluetooth scanning service
  - `Device.java`: Device data model
  - `Encounter.java`: Encounter data model
  - `DBAdapter.java`: Database management
  - `MainMenu.java`: Main application activity
  - `ViewAllDevices.java`: Device list activity
  - `ViewDevice.java`: Individual device detail activity
  - `OnlineLeaderboard.java`: Leaderboard activity

## Version

Current version: 1.0.5 (8/02/12)
